# Default arguments of the test build on a kiosk machine: scripts/deploy-test.sh
# installs this file as ocw-desktop.args beside the binary (@DIR@ = the
# install directory), only if the world package was installed. The kiosk's
# own command line comes after these and wins. Format: apps/desktop/src/argsfile.rs.
--world @DIR@/liechtenstein.ocwpkg
# Kiosk show mode (user, 2026-11-13): always ride on the virtual trainer at
# 500 W, so the rider moves and pedals (the virtual trainer reports a matching
# cadence, ~95 rpm) even with nobody on the KICKR. Change it in the menu or
# with the console (`sim.power`), or drop these lines to ride the trainer.
--virtual
--power 500
